        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "C_{\\theta}\\left(M,V,b_{w},d\\right)\\coloneq\\mathrm{if}\\left(N_{Ed}<0\\,\\mathrm{kN},C_{T}\\left(M,V,b_{w},d\\right),C_{o}\\left(b_{w},d,V\\right)\\right)",
